														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2405487">
									

<p>This bothered me as well, but the quoted &quot;scripture&quot; does explain that Tlaloc's priests were cast out post-curse because&#8230; well, I'd rather not live next door to a bunch of unrotting skeleton monsters, either. Can't blame 'em. So that might explain why we're seeing Aztec deities/metaphysical concepts where we normally wouldn't expect to see them.</p>
<p>Still&#8230; the Aztec gods being referenced here still seem wrong somehow. And the actual quoted &quot;artifact&quot; explains things a bit top nicely and comes off rather narmy. That's the real reason for my downvote.</p>

